{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026x6fqKcpvJ51795507182.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>小西灣有鹹水管爆裂，導致小西灣道路陷。路陷面積橫跨兩條行車線，工程人員緊急搶修。</p><p></p><p>現場是小西灣道18號、近富景花園，早上近七時半有地下鹹水管爆裂，導致附近兩個屋苑停鹹水。水務署隨即派員閂水掣。受事故影響，小西灣道西行道路封閉，途經巴士要改道。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.179836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:57:15.551187+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:17.939292+00:00","content_hash":"a520f8eca90a393b89ab979a99b076e8c27f2c0e0c37669bc813d22ee1dc1c8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:03.179836+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}